{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"USN-8292-1","published":"2026-05-21T14:28:35Z","modified":"2026-05-21T21:32:57.062127362Z","related":["UBUNTU-CVE-2026-4424","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-4426","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-5121"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-4424","CVE-2026-4426","CVE-2026-5121","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-4424","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-4426","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-5121"],"summary":"libarchive vulnerabilities","details":"It was discovered that libarchive incorrectly handled certain RAR\narchives. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause an\nout-of-bounds read via a crafted RAR archive, leading to sensitive\nmemory disclosure. (CVE-2026-4424)\n\nIt was discovered that libarchive incorrectly handled certain ISO files.\nAn attacker could possibly use this issue to cause incorrect memory\nallocation via a crafted ISO file, leading to a denial of service.\n(CVE-2026-4426)\n\nIt was discovered that libarchive incorrectly handled block pointer\nallocation in zisofs on 32-bit systems. An attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to cause a heap buffer overflow via a crafted ISO9660 image,\npossibly leading to arbitrary code execution. (CVE-2026-5121)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libarchive","ecosystem":"Ubuntu:Pro:14.04:LTS","purl":"pkg:deb/ubuntu/libarchive?arch=source&distro=esm-infra-legacy%2Ftrusty"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.1.2-7ubuntu2.8+esm5"}]}],"versions":["3.1.2-5ubuntu1","3.1.2-7ubuntu1","3.1.2-7ubuntu2","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.1","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.2","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.3","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.4","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.6","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.7","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.8","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.8+esm1","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.8+esm3","3.1.2-7ubuntu2.8+esm4"],"ecosystem_specific":{"availability":"Available with Ubuntu Pro with Legacy support add-on: https://ubuntu.com/pro","binaries":[{"binary_name":"bsdcpio","binary_version":"3.1.2-7ubuntu2.8+esm5"},{"binary_name":"bsdtar","binary_version":"3.1.2-7ubuntu2.8+esm5"},{"binary_name":"libarchive13","binary_version":"3.1.2-7ubuntu2.8+esm5"}]},"database_s